The project's voice in a guide, where the reader is the one acting.
-- hit/guide --
A codec per host would cost us upkeep.
We keep our cache; the cost is ours.
Let's add a target.
We added a flag.
-- pass/guide --
Set the locale to en-US.
Pass `--ours`, or the side git calls "ours".
Add a target, then run it.
